  "notes": [
    "Prices and article numbers were read from ikea.com/ca on 2026-10-13. They change.",
    "Frames, fronts, legs, rails, hinges, toe kicks, and cover panels are separate articles.",
    "This catalog is a working subset: white frames, Canada door fronts for AXSTAD, VOXTORP, ENKÖPING, HAVSTORP, BODBYN, and LERHYTTAN, EKBACKEN white-marble-effect worktops, and the hardware those frames ask for. A chosen front is transferred onto every cabinet frame. Door colors in the model are original schematic textures. A published color chip is named when IKEA.ca returned one.",
    "Interior fittings, sinks, appliances, lighting, and deco strips are not in the purchase list.",
    "Filler strips are cut from FÖRBÄTTRA cover panels. A door cabinet keeps 2 inches clear of a wall. A refrigerator keeps 4 inches clear of a wall. Drawer cabinets would keep 1 inch; this planner has no drawer cabinets yet.",
    "EKBACKEN rows on the search page publish length and thickness. The model uses a 25 5/8 inch worktop depth, which is the usual depth of that worktop, and the packet says so.",
    "The corner base frame is 38 inches along the wall and about 38 inches on the return. The corner wall frame is 26 inches on each run. Both figures come from the Canada product pages.",
    "Cabinet boxes in the GLB are original schematic geometry at these published sizes."
  ],
